<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A5.SS4.SSS3" title="In E.4 Random Hadamard transforms ‣ Appendix E Ablation of Training Methodology ‣ Pretraining Large Language Models with NVFP4" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.4.3 </span>Role of randomization</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS5" title="In Appendix E Ablation of Training Methodology ‣ Pretraining Large Language Models with NVFP4" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.5 </span>Consistent representations between tensors</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
